# App improve loop — CONTINUE UNPROMPTED (training)

When this agent touches Generate, History, Address Book, restore UX, startup, or
general app reliability, **own the app improve loop**. Same training contract as
logo / Shipping / BOL (see `improve-loops-training.mdc`).

## Mandatory loop

1. Read `qa_app/synthetic/improve_summary_latest.json` (create/run if missing).
2. Fix real top failures (crashes, empty PDFs, history wipe-on-open, slow budgets,
   address load failures, restore hangs).
3. Re-run: `python scripts/app_improve_loop.py` from repo root.
4. Append lessons to `qa_app/synthetic/training_lessons.json`.
5. Expand cases when new glitches appear.

Docs: `qa_app/synthetic/README.md`.

## Curriculum focus

- Cold start / storage open timing
- Shipping + Receiving + BOL (+ Bulk if cheap) generate success + timing
- Rapid generate loop (no crash)
- Logo restore path timing (honest budgets; skip generative if env lacks engines)
- Address book load / search smoke
- History retention (no prune-on-open regression)
- General errors, glitches, shortcomings surfaced by scores

## Constraints

- Do not break Shipping SO/Contact lock or invent logo redraws.
- Do not commit/push unless the user asked.
- Prefer adjusting **budgets** for `logo_restore_cubic` over “optimizing” by
  skipping real restore work — document honest machine-class limits in lessons.
